cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Long-Endurance UAV Fuselage: Material Selection and Manufacturing Design"
abstract: >-
  Ashby-based material selection for the airframe of a ducted quadcopter: merit indices written as
  constrained minimisation problems, hard-constraint screening, weighted decision
  matrix, process engineering and CAD, with a benchmark against a published UAV material-selection thesis.
type: software
